---
const lang = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_LANG || 'en';
const text = lang === 'ko'
  ? '이 글에는 Amazon Associates를 포함한 제휴 링크(유료 링크)가 포함됩니다. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. 추천은 협찬·광고비가 아닌 자료 검토와 비교 기준을 우선합니다.'
  : 'This article contains affiliate links (paid links), including Amazon Associates links. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. Recommendations are based on source review, product fit, and practical comparison criteria—not paid placement.';
---

<aside class="affiliate-disclosure" role="note" aria-label="Affiliate disclosure">
  <strong class="block mb-1">
    {lang === 'ko' ? '⚖️ 제휴 링크 안내' : '⚖️ Affiliate Disclosure'}
  </strong>
  <p>{text}</p>
</aside>
